HB0012 Industrial production equipment-deferral.
Sponsored By: Joint Minerals, Business & Economic Development
Interim Committee
AN ACT relating to taxation and revenue; providing an ad valorem tax deferral
for the storage of industrial production equipment in the state; specifying
conditions and requirements for the deferral; providing definitions; and
providing for an effective date.
